            "text": "Press Play below to hear the tune: the mic starts with it. Sing along on the note names.\nOnce you can start on Sol without hearing it first, try it in another key. Use the Key selector below to change the key, then press Play to hear the tune there.\nWhen you change the key, the notes change but the tune still steps down from Sol to Do."
